      "conversationId": "conv-1789826156948-ul43l",
      "role": "bot",
      "text": "I see you're testing the system. Everything is working correctly. \n\nTo get started, please let me know what you'd like help with:\n\n- **Coding** - Need assistance with a specific project, bug, or implementation?\n- **Document creation** - Want to write or format a report, article, or presentation?\n- **Research** - Looking for information on a topic?\n- **Analysis** - Have data or files you'd like analyzed?\n\nJust tell me your task and I'll dive right in.",
      "status": "completed",
